|!
!|*|!         Reset the screen
!|S0101|!     Setup the fill color (blue)
!|=00000001|! Solid line 1 pixel wide
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Show our grid (center points)
!|!
!|N01|c08
!|!
!|! Show horizontal lines first
!|!
!|L0015HR15
!|L003FHR3F
!|L005PHR5P
!|L007THR7T
!|!
!|! Now show the vertical lines
!|!
!|L2000209Q
!|L5000509Q
!|L8000809Q
!|LB000B09Q
!|LE000E09Q
!|!
!|! Change settings for subsequent example figures
!|!
!|c0F|!       Set color to white
!|=00000003|! Solid line 3 pixel wide
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Show RIP_SKEWED_OVAL
!|!
!|N01|&20151G0M1M
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Show RIP_FILLED_SKEWED_OVAL
!|!       
!|N01|-203F1G0M1M|!  With    a border
!|N00|-205P1G0M1M|!  Without a border
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Show a RIP_SKEWED_OVAL_ARC
!|!
!|N01|]50151G0M20601M
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Show a RIP_SKEWED_OVAL_PIE_SLICE
!|!
!|N01|[503F1G0M20601M|! With    a border
!|N00|[505P1G0M20601M|! Without a border
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Show a RIP_SKEWED_OVAL_CHORD
!|!
!|N01|+803F1G0M20601M|! With    a border
!|N00|+805P1G0M20601M|! Without a border
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Show a RIP_FILLED_OVAL_CHORD
!|!
!|N01|_B03F90601G0M|! With    a border
!|N00|_B05P90601G0M|! Without a border
!|!
!|!---------
!|! All done
!|!---------
!|#|#|#
